    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      259.37,
      401.9,
      284.51
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      300.77,
      401.86,
      325.91
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Companies (Amendment)Act, No. of 2018.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      342.17,
      401.92,
      408.71
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 5 of the Companies Act, No. 07 of 2007(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is herebyamended in subsection (1) by the repeal of paragraphs (b)and (c) thereof and the substitution therefor, of thefollowing:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.61,
      424.97,
      401.89,
      450.11
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(b) assign a unique number to that company as itscompany number;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      178.89,
      466.37,
      401.86,
      491.51
    ],
    "text": "(c) issue a certificate of incorporation in the prescribedform to the applicant company; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      178.05,
      507.77,
      401.89,
      574.31
    ],
    "text": "(d) notify the general public, within sixty working daysof the incorporation of a company, by a noticepublished in a daily newspaper which hascirculation in Sinhala, English and Tamil languageswhich shall specify\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      196.89,
      590.57,
      308.65,
      601.91
    ],
    "text": "(i)name of the company;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      193.89,
      618.17,
      373.91,
      629.51
    ],
    "text": "(ii)the company registration number; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      190.89,
      645.77,
      401.88,
      670.91
    ],
    "text": "(iii)the address of the registered office of thecompany.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
