      225.83
    ],
    "text": "3.Section 9 of the principal enactment is herebyamended as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      173.47,
      238.49,
      368.0,
      249.83
    ],
    "text": "(1) by the repeal of subsection (1) thereof; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
