      300.23
    ],
    "text": "(2) in subsection (3) thereof, by the substitution for thewords \u201csubsection (1) or (2)\u201d of the words,\u201csubsection (2)\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      313.13,
      397.2,
      362.27
    ],
    "text": "4.Section 10 of the principal enactment is herebyamended by the repeal of paragraph (b) of subsection (1)thereof, and the substitution therefor, of the followingparagraph:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      185.47,
      386.33,
      397.17,
      444.47
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(b)a request is made to the Registrar to do sowithin three months of public notice of thename being given under section 5(1)(d) andsection 9(2) by another company or by aregistered overseas company, where\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      226.15,
      456.53,
      397.16,
      503.03
    ],
    "text": "(i) the name of the first mentionedcompany is so similar to the name ofthe requesting company that it is likelyto cause confusion; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      223.15,
      515.21,
      397.17,
      561.95
    ],
    "text": "(ii) the requesting company was registeredwith its current name before the firstmentioned company was registeredwith the name objected to; or\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      586.61,
      397.2,
      609.95
    ],
    "text": "5. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
